+      {
+        "question": "Is Form ADV public?",
+        "answer": "Yes, Form ADV is a public document. Form ADV filings for registered investment advisory firms and their representatives are public on the SEC Investment Adviser Public Disclosure database."
+      },
+      {
+        "question": "How do I search Form ADV?",
+        "answer": "You can search Form ADV by visiting the Investor.gov Check Out Your Investment Professional search tool, which directs you to the SEC Investment Adviser Public Disclosure portal. Enter the firm or individual advisor name to view their current filings."
+      },
+      {
+        "question": "What is Form ADV Part 2A?",
